  "note": "NIOS states its syllabus as a bifurcation table: one row per module, with that module's lessons split between the tutor-marked assignment (40 per cent) and the public examination (60 per cent). Units here are the modules and topics are the lessons, merged back into lesson order. NIOS runs a course, not a class-by-class syllabus; the secondary course is equivalent to class 10 and the senior secondary course to class 12. Version note: the bifurcation document NIOS publishes is the 2023 edition, which is the edition still in force; this file is stamped version 2023 and applies_to 2026-27 rather than claiming a 2026-27 document that does not exist."
